# Static-host header config (Cloudflare Pages / Netlify format).
#
# NOT READ BY THE CURRENT HOST: tacit.finance serves from Render, and Render's
# static-site product does not read a _headers file. The `/*` headers below are
# served all the same, because they are set on the site itself (Settings →
# Headers, or its API; https://render.com/docs/static-site-headers). Keep this
# file as the canonical set to copy there, and update the site when it changes.
# The cross-origin isolation headers of the front page and /tac/ are not here:
# they are in tools/site-isolation-rules.mjs, set by tools/site-isolation-headers.mjs.
# (`server: cloudflare` and `cf-*` on a response are Render's own CDN, not a zone of ours.)
#
# CSP frame-ancestors is the one directive browsers IGNORE when delivered via
# <meta> tag — it must come from an HTTP header. The dapp's <meta http-equiv>
# CSP at the top of index.html covers everything else; this file adds the
# clickjacking defense that meta can't do.
#
# 'self' (not 'none') so a hosted production deployment can still iframe its
# own /modal /preview etc. routes if it ever adds them. Tighten to 'none' if
# the dapp will never iframe itself.
#
# X-Frame-Options is the legacy equivalent for browsers that don't honor
# frame-ancestors yet (Edge < 79, IE). Modern browsers prefer the CSP one.

/*
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'self'
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), usb=(), bluetooth=(), serial=(), hid=(), payment=()

# Files other apps load or vendor: the standalone EVM pool wallet and its ceremony files, and the address kit.
/evm-pool/*
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *

/kit/*
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
